#: aot_flask/templates/settings/user_detail.html:16
msgid ""
"Note: Password and keypad code fields are empty. Enter values and save to"
" change. Leave empty to keep current settings. To disable keypad code, "
"enter 0 and save."
msgstr ""
"Напомена: Поља за лозинку и код на тастатури су празна. Унесите вредности"
